Jade for Horizon
================

Unofficial port of Jade to Horizon (WebAssembly mod API 0.2).

Original work: Jade by Snownee and contributors
  https://github.com/Snownee/Jade
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

This project is an adaptation of the idea and behaviour of Jade, rewritten in Rust for Horizon.
It was modified from the original: it is a new codebase for a different game API, and implements
only a subset of Jade's features. No Minecraft or Mojang assets or data are included; block and
item icons and names are read at runtime from the player's own game.

This adaptation is shared under the same licence, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. See the LICENSE file.
